  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="7de85d7c-2255-5026-b12f-a6dc19a46058" activityNameId="dac4fbe6-9ab1-52d8-b89b-0c3bd82f4b9d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium, enriched 3.9%, at EURODIF enrichment plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium, enriched 3.9%, at EURODIF enrichment plant
This module does not use data specific for the EURODIF plant, except the electricity consumption per unit of SWU (2400 kWh/SWU) and its supply by nuclear power plants. However, the indirect environmental burdens imported through the high electricity uses are fully represented. Only few information were available for emission species to air and water from US model diffusion plants;
UUID: 5962284b-5870-3fc6-8429-eb6da4235316
The module includes: input of UF6; electricity and light fuel oil used for operation; water use, lubricant oil, and wastewater treatment; transport requirements of operation materials, industrial wastes, and contaminated waste from decommissioning (25% of the reinforced concrete and the great part of metals according to the reference). Radioactive and non-radioactive emissions to air and to water from the operation are also included. The infrastructure requirements are accounted for, though construction and operation data partially refer to different plants rather than to one single unit.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Eurodif uranium enrichment diffusion plant started operation in the late 1970s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5962284b-5870-3fc6-8429-eb6da4235316.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
